{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53396","headline":"善卷祠 · 薛巽","name":"善卷祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子长爱奇故不收，况乃着论非许由。\n先生踪迹重埋没，引舜作证应点头。\n天下大器尚不欲，万古虚名岂愿留？\n江北漫空山不静，说着高风簪可投。\n（同治《武陵县志》卷四八。\n本诗爲陶敏先生录示，小传亦从陶说。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛巽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}